--TEST--
an anonymous object written on one line is a list like an array literal, so a cursor on one of its keys is offered to put each field on a line of its own, `rule:types/anonymous-object`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $point = {x: 1, y<|>: 2};
echo $point->y, "\n";
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
2:14-2:26 refactor.rewrite Put on separate lines -> "{\n    x: 1,\n    y: 2,\n}"
